{
  "ID": "47571",
  "post_title": "Vuelve el aire festivo a Onda con la reina de la Colla Gegantera y las fiestas de Sant Pere",
  "post_date": "2014-06-28 09:24:00",
  "post_name": "vuelve-el-aire-festivo-a-onda-con-la-reina-de-la-colla-gegantera-y-las-fiestas-de-sant-pere",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_7271.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Onda vuelve a estar inmersa en la fiesta, ya que este viernes se ha presentado en el Raval a la reina de la Colla Gegantera Sant Roc, Eva Navarro Mora (148 fotos en la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes de abajo), y se han inciado las fiestas del barrio de Sant Pere, con la colocaci&oacute;n del mural y el pasacalle hasta la Morer&iacute;a para recoger la llave festiva (&uacute;ltimas fotos de a galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes).</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/06/IMG_7444.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El programa completo de actos de las fiestas del barrio de Sant Pere, que se desarrollar&aacute;n hasta el domingo 6 de julio, es el siguiente:</span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">S&Aacute;BADO 28 DE JUNIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A DE LA MUJER</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">9.00 h.: Despert&agrave; y almuerzo de sobaquillo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">13.00 h.: Concentraci&oacute;n de las mujeres en el Portal de Sant Pere, acompa&ntilde;adas por la Charanga &quot;Llenya al bombo&quot;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">14.00 h.: Comida de las Socias de la Vaca.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">18.00 h.: Entrada de vacas de la ganader&iacute;a Hnos. Guillam&oacute;n. Suelta de la Vaca de las Mujeres.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">19.00 h.: Exhibici&oacute;n del toro de la ganader&iacute;a Aldeaquemada, de nombre Criadito, N&ordm; 3 y Guarismo 9. Salida: Casa Trini.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">A continuaci&oacute;n vacas.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.: Embolada de la vaca: Casa &quot;Sunci&oacute;n&quot;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Segunda embolada del Toro del Barrio (C/ Perdiz). Embolada patrocinada por Alejandro y Javi. EmboladoresQuebr&agrave;.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">DOMINGO 29 DE JUNIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>FESTIVIDAD DE SAN PEDRO</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">11.00 h.: Misa en sufragio por todos los difuntos del Barrio en la Parroquia Virgen del Carmen.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">15.30 h.: Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">19.00 h.: Procesi&oacute;n y traslado de la imagen de San Pedro a la Parroquia Ntra. Sra. de la Asunci&oacute;n acompa&ntilde;ados por &quot;Els dol&ccedil;ainers d&#39;Artesa&quot;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">(Refresco para los socios y acompa&ntilde;antes a la procesi&oacute;n).</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.: Actuaci&oacute;n del D&uacute;o Dueto.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">LUNES 30 DE JUNIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A DEL NI&Ntilde;O</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">10.00 h.: Hinchables en El Bass&oacute;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">12.00 h.: Reparto de la carne del toro.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">14.00 h.: Comida para los ni&ntilde;os.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">17.00 h.: Hinchables en El Bass&oacute;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">22.30 h.: Pasacalle de disfraces, acompa&ntilde;ados por la Charanga &quot;Llenya al bombo&quot;.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">MARTES 1 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A PATROCINADO POR &quot;MANOLO EL CHATO&quot;</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">15.30 h.: Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">18.00 h.: Entrada de vacas de D. Armando Beltr&aacute;n Colom.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.: Embolada del primer toro. (Casa Trini).</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">A continuaci&oacute;n, embolada del segundo toro en la Plaza Morera.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Emboladas a cargo de EmboladorsSant Pere i Consultora.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">MI&Eacute;RCOLES 2 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A DEL NI&Ntilde;O</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">15.30 h.: Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.00 h.: Disco m&oacute;vil y Fiesta de la Espuma.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">JUEVES 3 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A DE LA TERCERA EDAD</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">13.00 h.: Comida.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">18.00 h.: Entrada de vacas de la ganader&iacute;a Hnos. Guillam&oacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">19.00 h.: Suelta del Toro del Barrio desde la calle La Safona, de la ganader&iacute;a de la Victoria, nombre Caja, n&uacute;mero 18 y guarismo 1.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.: Embolada del Toro del Barrio (Casa Trini) a cargo de EmboladorsSant Pere i Consultora.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">VIERNES 4 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">12.00 h.: Reparto de refrescos para los socios.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">15.30 h.: Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">21.00 h.: Cena de socios y a continuaci&oacute;n Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.: Actuaci&oacute;n de Ronda 7.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">S&Aacute;BADO 5 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>D&Iacute;A DE LOS J&Oacute;VENES</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">9.00 h.: Despert&agrave; a cargo de El Ma&ntilde;ol y Cobos.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">10.00 h.: Almuerzo para los socios j&oacute;venes.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">14.00 h.: Comida de los socios del toro.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">18.00 h.: Entrada de vacas de Hnos. Guillam&oacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">19.00 h.: Exhibici&oacute;n del toro del Barrio, de nombre Pesadillo, N&ordm; 216 y guarismo 9, de la ganader&iacute;a de Joaqu&iacute;n N&uacute;&ntilde;ez.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Seguidamente la merienda de los socios y a continuaci&oacute;n, vacas.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La tarde estar&aacute; amenizada por la Charanga &quot;Llenya al bombo&quot;.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">23.30 h.:Primera embolada: Toro de Hermanos Guillam&oacute;n en la C/ La Merced.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Segunda embolada: Toro de los J&oacute;venes en la Plaza Morera.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Emboladas a cargo de EmboladorsSant Pere i Consultora.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Al finalizar las emboladas, desmont&agrave; del corro y barreras.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">DOMINGO 6 DE JULIO</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">14.00 h.: Comida de socios. Seguidamente, Bingo.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">19.00 h.: Bajada del mural.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">22.30 h.: Disparo de cohetes.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7248.jpg\" alt=\"img_7248\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7250.jpg\" alt=\"img_7250\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7252.jpg\" alt=\"img_7252\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7253.jpg\" alt=\"img_7253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7254.jpg\" alt=\"img_7254\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7255.jpg\" alt=\"img_7255\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7256.jpg\" alt=\"img_7256\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7257.jpg\" alt=\"img_7257\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7258.jpg\" alt=\"img_7258\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7259.jpg\" alt=\"img_7259\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7260.jpg\" alt=\"img_7260\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7261.jpg\" alt=\"img_7261\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7262.jpg\" alt=\"img_7262\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7263.jpg\" alt=\"img_7263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7264.jpg\" alt=\"img_7264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7265.jpg\" alt=\"img_7265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7266.jpg\" alt=\"img_7266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7267.jpg\" alt=\"img_7267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7269.jpg\" alt=\"img_7269\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7271.jpg\" alt=\"img_7271\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/proclamacioreinacollageganterainicifestesbarrisantpere/img_7272.jpg\" alt=\"img_7272\" 